{"version":1,"content":"<p>今晨（26日）8時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指在元朗錦壆路近壆圍西路一貨倉被3隻狗追趕，並遭其中一隻狗咬傷小腿。</p><p>警方及救護員接報到場，傷者送往博愛醫院。</p><p>警方尋獲涉事狗主。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.443744+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:17:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:11.462039+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.533788+00:00","content_hash":"04c4c51f9075160ea7761e646ada4fcc29becf5427c63bd539680a98a10a1d67","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}